tFJ2QYxWwk0Q7kNvwH0BkgH&_nc_oc=AdpzMaTsA-jDNhH-b-_Twb8EMuI4xdwcmdRFkAtn5jR5eVbDEK4gdMHSoPWie7T6dQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af26TJmLbxrgn0ghER-w5c3dJDv3sEGuLDIuniQdkasWuA&oe=69E4E337"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r85qZHf2ZTIQ7kNvwH9Pqe8&_nc_oc=Ado8CNi0eWxoV_6YKxbcSvxiOEywblvK4zoK6fzUTqh299Y4VkuLJRSvrjGEmtBx-K8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0uoOl6qJOv7MVcYKAgbWqP70-GvtW076UvnimtZ6606Q&oe=69E4E4CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uKO9NrbKeQcQ7kNvwFbFUED&_nc_oc=AdpsD-Ciqn_orsz9-YGkBX-EnqX5sRu5oKVikdD7jTqpcsikL8p02o0IWIvByGIQTKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1E3N6jIrqtt4WJ05cNX_sSw_6qcHHXb8DggrpPgbcmAA&oe=69E4D1EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SHvxc3IhE78Q7kNvwHemQVo&_nc_oc=AdqamYuBMt0POvg-2ey9YE13aHxhdYX6E-YOWbub4lo8hqubzZ8mhcr2U0ZiwDDUE-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1kwh-a6z0C6i815LWmQDoq2TU7EUTGkSHwZH5Ip-5vxQ&oe=69E4BB43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ExAkK7kEJ0Q7kNvwEXM53f&_nc_oc=Adpxxym8nUDEXt6ra-Qvxo26OzBEL0jurKQO_J0gkSlnOlhUp6QgYYBDvPpWguQCYyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0yLgBhw41_ju3uxwJHHmHfbGMFJVW3dXQZAg6ChzecAA&oe=69E4EBD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tq8-B5FIhYIQ7kNvwFc_3qE&_nc_oc=AdobVriEjvDQR77Jo84MsSdOf5oDT8uoYAtogF5sMLdLcSUvnjG5gAH2pMoALjhztqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af110YFnBIETouD5OrxL-AuduQpEUFDFLIXuQOyUgCGeIw&oe=69E4C6BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080